// Town NPC placement — consumed by `TownNpcBuilder` in
// `src/map/builders/town_npcs.rs`. Each entry is "spawn N copies of
// `<npc>` using `<placement>` strategy". The `npc` string keys into
// `monsters.ron` (NPCs reuse the monster pipeline; their non-hostile
// behaviour comes from their `faction:` field, not a separate spawn
// path).
//
// Placement strategies the builder understands:
//   - AnywhereInTown   — random walkable Floor east of the water
//                        strip, outside any building interior.
//                        Roam bounds = the whole town land area.
//
// Future placements (not yet implemented):
//   - Pier { index: Option<u8> }
//   - BuildingInterior(role)
(
    spawns: [
        // Three drunken sailors stagger around the town centre.
        ( npc: "Drunken Sailor", count: 3, placement: AnywhereInTown ),
    ],
)
